   (ResD_OOBFlag( '0' ) @ #s) ∧
   (AFMITMI( '0' ) @ #m) ∧
   (AFMITMR( '1' ) @ #n)
  ⇒
   ∃ #p #q. (InitDPE( ) @ #p) ∧ (ResDPE( ) @ #q)) ∧
 (∀ #m #n #r #s.
   (InitD_IOCapability( 'KeyboardOnly' ) @ #m) ∧
   (ResD_IOCapability( 'KeyboardOnly' ) @ #n) ∧
   (InitD_OOBFlag( '0' ) @ #r) ∧
   (ResD_OOBFlag( '0' ) @ #s) ∧
   (AFMITMI( '1' ) @ #m) ∧
   (AFMITMR( '1' ) @ #n)
